=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352420/extras/b05e8cf03cf10fc1877f9580e9970720.webp?t=1711112486\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352420/extras/f49aa43fbe8bac23f97d1e6943e290c8.poster.avif?t=1711112486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352420/extras/f49aa43fbe8bac23f97d1e6943e290c8.webm?t=1711112486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352420/extras/a44046e6a7d2109828d3319f8af10971.avif?t=1711112486\" /></span><br>The only way to win is to become the King of the Garden in the Garden of Fame. Beat your friends by mastering your strategy and never sharing your gardening tips and tricks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352420/extras/b05e8cf03cf10fc1877f9580e9970720.webp?t=1711112486\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352420/extras/579980f72a17e43f03e29bedfbaa5722.poster.avif?t=1711112486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352420/extras/579980f72a17e43f03e29bedfbaa5722.webm?t=1711112486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352420/extras/579980f72a17e43f03e29bedfbaa5722.mp4?t=1711112486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352420/extras/99d3f61f32d03777a23b9af7060b2960.avif?t=1711112486\" /></span><br>Learn by doing. Complete all micro-quests that teach you the mechanics and systems to unlock a unique plant.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352420/extras/b05e8cf03cf10fc1877f9580e9970720.webp?t=1711112486\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352420/extras/e8b2502db72d4aa38b7bb0cba1edd5cf.poster.avif?t=1711112486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352420/extras/e8b2502db72d4aa38b7bb0cba1edd5cf.webm?t=1711112486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
